    "title": "Fire Destroys Baltimore Roofing Company Warehouse - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tribune Content Agency ,\n16 hours ago A three-alarm fire destroyed a roofing company’s warehouse in an industrial area of East Baltimore on Tuesday afternoon, and is now under investigation by local and state officials. Baltimore City fire crews responded to the fire at Alliance Roofing Company around 3 p.m., according to Deputy Chief Khalilah Yancey.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
